<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Postpartum Haemorrhage Infographic</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #e9f2f5;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .infographic-container {
            width: 1200px;
            position: relative;
            background-color: #e9f2f5;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        /* Top Decorative Cloud */
        .cloud-top-right {
            position: absolute;
            top: -10px;
            right: 40px;
            width: 150px;
            height: 70px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 40px;
            z-index: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #ccc;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .cloud-bottom-left {
            position: absolute;
            top: 550px;
            left: 260px;
            width: 160px;
            height: 80px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 50px 50px 0 0;
            z-index: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #ccc;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        /* Header */
        .header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .header-pill {
            border: 2px solid #4a2c7a;
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            color: #4a2c7a;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
            background: white;
        }
        .header-text-small {
            color: #4a2c7a;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .header-title {
            color: #4a2c7a;
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }

        /* Main Layout Grid */
        .main-content {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        /* Left Column */
        .left-col {
            width: 250px;
            background-color: #d9edf2;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* Right Flow Area */
        .right-area {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Wavy Background Approximation */
        .flow-bg {
            position: absolute;
            top: 60px;
            left: 0;
            right: 120px;
            height: 140px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 70px;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        /* Flow Steps */
        .flow-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            padding-right: 20px;
        }

        .step {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            width: 170px;
        }
        .step-m { margin-top: 30px; }
        .step-o { margin-top: 70px; }
        .step-t { margin-top: 40px; }
        .step-iv { margin-top: -10px; }
        .step-e-right { margin-top: -20px; }

        .letter {
            font-size: 55px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #4a2c7a;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .icon-circle {
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 3px solid #6b9eb0;
            background-color: #fff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #e0f2f5 0%, #fff 100%);
        }

        /* Text Boxes & Lists */
        .box-title {
            border: 1px solid #6b9eb0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 10px;
            background: white;
            color: #4a2c7a;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-align: center;
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        .box-title.purple-border {
            border-color: #4a2c7a;
        }

        .list-container {
            border-left: 1px solid #6b9eb0;
            margin-left: 10px;
            padding-left: 15px;
            margin-top: 5px;
            align-self: flex-start;
        }
        .list-container-left {
            border-left: none;
            margin-left: 0;
            padding-left: 0;
        }

        ul.teal-list {
            list-style-type: disc;
            padding-left: 15px;
            margin: 0;
            color: #276e85;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        ul.teal-list li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        ul.teal-list strong {
            color: #174a5c;
        }

        /* Specific to Left Column */
        .trigger-section {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .trigger-badge {
            background: white;
            color: #174a5c;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }
        .trigger-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #276e85;
        }
        .trigger-number {
            color: #4a2c7a;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 1;
        }
        .logos {
            margin-top: auto;
            padding-top: 30px;
            width: 140px;
            height: 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #eee;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 12px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        /* Implementation Strategies Box */
        .impl-box {
            background-color: #f6fbfa;
            border: 2px solid #a9c8d4;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            z-index: 1;
            position: relative;
        }
        .impl-title {
            color: #4a2c7a;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .impl-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            column-gap: 40px;
            row-gap: 30px;
        }
        .impl-item {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        .impl-icon {
            width: 60px;
            height: 50px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #e0f2f5;
            border: 1px solid #a9c8d4;
            border-radius: 5px;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .impl-text {
            color: #276e85;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        .impl-text strong {
            color: #174a5c;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="infographic-container">

    <div class="cloud-top-right placeholder">[Cloud shape]</div>
    <div class="cloud-bottom-left placeholder">[Cloud shape]</div>

    <div class="header">
        <div class="header-pill">DETECT</div>
        <div class="header-text-small">AND</div>
        <div class="header-pill">TREAT</div>
        <div class="header-title">POSTPARTUM HAEMORRHAGE EARLY</div>
    </div>

    <div class="main-content">
        <!-- LEFT COLUMN: E & Trigger Criteria -->
        <div class="left-col">
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <div class="letter">E</div>
                <div class="icon-circle placeholder" style="margin: 0 auto 20px auto; border-color: #4a2c7a;">[Icon:<br>Drape]</div>
            </div>

            <div class="box-title purple-border" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                Early detection<br>and trigger criteria
            </div>

            <div class="list-container-left">
                <ul class="teal-list">
                    <li>Calibrated drape for blood loss collection with trigger lines at <strong>300ml and 500ml</strong> for the first hour after birth</li>
                    <li>Observations (blood loss, blood flow, uterine tone) every <strong>15 minutes</strong> documented on the blood loss monitoring chart</li>
                    <li>Blood pressure and pulse carried out once in the <strong>1st hour</strong> postpartum and documented on the blood loss monitoring chart</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="trigger-section">
                <div class="trigger-badge">Trigger criteria</div>

                <div class="trigger-item">
                    <div class="trigger-number">1</div>
                    <div>Clinical judgement</div>
                </div>
                <div class="trigger-item">
                    <div class="trigger-number">2</div>
                    <div>Blood loss 500ml or more</div>
                </div>
                <div class="trigger-item">
                    <div class="trigger-number">3</div>
                    <div>Blood loss 300ml or more plus one abnormal observation</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="logos placeholder">[Logos: WHO / hrp]</div>
        </div>

        <!-- RIGHT AREA: Flow & Implementation -->
        <div class="right-area">

            <div class="flow-bg"></div>

            <div class="flow-container">
                <!-- M -->
                <div class="step step-m">
                    <div class="letter">M</div>
                    <div class="icon-circle placeholder">[Icon:<br>Massage]</div>
                    <div class="box-title">Massage of uterus</div>
                    <div class="list-container">
                        <ul class="teal-list">
                            <li>Massage until uterus has contracted or for <strong>one minute</strong></li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- O -->
                <div class="step step-o">
                    <div class="letter">O</div>
                    <div class="icon-circle placeholder">[Icon:<br>Syringe 1]</div>
                    <div class="box-title">Oxytocic drugs</div>
                    <div class="list-container">
                        <ul class="teal-list">
                            <li><strong>10 IU IV oxytocin injection</strong> or diluted in <strong>200-500ml crystalloid</strong> over <strong>10 minutes</strong> plus a maintenance dose for <strong>20 IU IV oxytcin</strong> diluted in <strong>1000ml saline</strong> over <strong>4 hours</strong> (+- misoprostol 800mcg PR/SL if used)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- T -->
                <div class="step step-t">
                    <div class="letter">T</div>
                    <div class="icon-circle placeholder">[Icon:<br>Syringe 2]</div>
                    <div class="box-title">Tranexamic acid</div>
                    <div class="list-container">
                        <ul class="teal-list">
                            <li><strong>1g IV injection of tranexamic acid</strong> or diluted in <strong>200ml crystalloid</strong> over <strong>10 minutes</strong></li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- IV -->
                <div class="step step-iv">
                    <div class="letter">IV</div>
                    <div class="icon-circle placeholder">[Icon:<br>IV Fluid]</div>
                    <div class="box-title">IV fluids</div>
                    <div class="list-container">
                        <ul class="teal-list">
                            <li>IV fluids in addition to the infusion should be given if clinically indicated for resuscitation and will require a <strong>2nd IV access</strong></li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- E (Right) -->
                <div class="step step-e-right">
                    <div class="letter">E</div>
                    <div class="icon-circle placeholder" style="border-color: #4a2c7a;">[Icon:<br>Magnifying]</div>
                    <div class="box-title purple-border">Examination<br>and escalation</div>
                    <div class="list-container">
                        <ul class="teal-list">
                            <li>Ensure bladder is empty, evacuate clots, check for tears with an internal examination and placenta for completeness</li>
                            <li>Escalate if bleeding does not stop after first response or you are unable to identify or manage cause of bleeding</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Implementation Box -->
            <div class="impl-box">
                <h2 class="impl-title">Implementation strategies</h2>
                <div class="impl-grid">

                    <div class="impl-item">
                        <div class="impl-icon placeholder">[Icon:<br>Document]</div>
                        <div class="impl-text">
                            <strong>Audit newsletters:</strong> sharing with all staff monthly detection and bundle use rates along with PPH, severe PPH, blood transfusion, laparotomy and death from PPH rates and given feedback at monthly departmental meetings
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="impl-item">
                        <div class="impl-icon placeholder">[Icon:<br>Bag]</div>
                        <div class="impl-text">
                            <strong>Trolley and/or carry case:</strong> including all medicines and devices required for the treatment of PPH restocked after every use and complete a stocking checklist at the start of every shift
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="impl-item">
                        <div class="impl-icon placeholder">[Icon:<br>Trophy]</div>
                        <div class="impl-text">
                            <strong>Champions:</strong> midwife and doctor to oversee change, troubleshoot, give feedback on audit newsletters, connect with other champions through chats, meeting and websites for sharing knowledge and lessons learnt
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="impl-item">
                        <div class="impl-icon placeholder">[Icon:<br>Flipchart]</div>
                        <div class="impl-text">
                            <strong>Training:</strong> on-site, simulation-based, and peer-assisted training of 90 minutes to a whole day facilitated by the use of provider guides, flipcharts and job aids displayed in labour wards
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
